ee town but Walt refuses to  let him leave unless he gives up the  names of Gus's men so Walt can silence  them before they have a chance to talk  the two men argue and Walt shoots Mike  to death before remembering that Lydia  also has access to that information with  the help of Todd's uncle who runs a crew  of neo-nazis Walt has Gus's men killed  before Hank can get them to give up any  information on Heisenberg with his  business safe and Todd proving to be in  a definite lab assistant Walt rakes in  the cash for months before finally  retiring that is until Hank finds a book  given to Walt by Gale on the toilet and  finally connects all the pieces even  though Walt is retired with plenty of  money Hank is on his trail just before  leaving town to start a new life Jesse  realizes that Walt was actually behind  Brock's poisoning which sends him on a  crusade against his former partner Hank  picks Jesse up before he can burn down  the white household and the two join  forces to gather evidence to take out  walk together they trick Walt into  revealing where he  his drug money and desperate Walt calls  his former neo-nazi partners for help  the neo-nazis arrived kill Hank and  kidnap Jesse Walt goes into hiding in  New Hampshire but after seeing Elliott  and Gretchen Schwartz on TV denying his  involvement in the company he co-founded  he comes back to tie up his loose ends  he forces Elliott and Gretchen to  launder the rest of his drug money for  his family and he admits to Skyler that  everything he did was for selfish  reasons one more time that you did this  for the family he then heads to the  neo-nazi compound kills the skinheads  and ultimately saves Jesse's life in the  process dying of blood loss from a stray  bullet  Walt collapses in the neo-nazis meth lab  surrounded by chemical equipment as the  police arrive check out one of our  newest videos right here plus even more  looper videos about your favorite TV  shows are coming soon subscribe to our  YouT